int improvement from the year prior, and we think there's room in the future as well, but we're not going to get into that at this point, Jack.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/23/toll-brothers-tol-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2018 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marty Connor","x":"We have seen the threat of tariffs be greater than the actual impact of tariffs to date, but we don't know how long that may continue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/04/toll-brothers-tol-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2018 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Maklari","x":"I know lumber has come down a lot, but I guess -- as we think about maybe some of the trade dynamics that have changed here more recently, the potential for tariffs maybe rising coming off, how are you thinking about some of the input costs looking forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/04/toll-brothers-tol-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2019-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We've obviously had price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2019-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"So I think it's helpful to recognize that we sell homes from $300,000 to $3 million and so the movement in any particular quarter of either average delivered price or average selling price is really driven by mix predominantly, not price increases or price incentives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"I mean that company was built to buy distressed portfolios of loans from banks and be a workout restructuring firm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We've had better markets and that team is in place for good markets and bad, either land bank or become a workout restructuring firm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2019-05-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Alan Ratner","x":"Any -- just any quick thoughts on tariffs and impact that that might have going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2019-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"But we had such huge price increases over the last three or four years that I think the market is digesting a bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2019-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"We've seen price increases in five of six of our regions on an average basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2019-05-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Bouley","x":"But as we look into 2020, do you suspect that you might be able to kind of rightsize some of the SG&A spend at all based on where the top line is.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2019-08-21","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Truman Patterson","x":"Have you guys seen the international buyer return at all or even potentially retraced given the intensifying trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2019-08-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"I did mention in my prepared comments that we have had some modest price increases in over 50% of our communities during the start of August.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2019-08-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We continue to struggle a bit in the Midwest with pricing power in Chicago and Detroit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2019-12-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We're encouraged in that cost in the fourth quarter for both labor and materials were flat and tariffs have not had an adverse impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2019-12-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"And we have backfilled many of those with new sales, in some cases at higher prices because of the community has seen significant price increases over those 24 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2019 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2019-12-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We are encouraged with recent sales activity that is giving us some pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2020-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We're not the Chinese tariffs or other international issues are not affecting the supply of our labor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"Demand has remained strong through the start of our second quarter, and we are experiencing pricing power in many of our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"Due to the rapid rise in interest rates in the summer and fall of 2018, this time frame became a buyers' market where we had negative pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2020-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"We attribute this to a combination of pre-COVID-19 pricing power, stronger cost controls and a favorable mix of deliveries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2020-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"I'm actually pleased that in a couple of locations, let's call it 10 to 20 around the country, we've had some modest price increases over the last three to four weeks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"These actions included, among other things, a hiring freeze and reductions to payroll through a combination of job eliminations and employee furloughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"Included in our second quarter SG&A is approximately $8 million in severance costs, offset by the reversal of an $8 million accrual for discretionary benefit plan contributions that will not be made.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2020-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"If this strength continues, we expect to keep raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2020-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"Should the current strong demand continue, we will keep raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"SG&A was lower this year and this quarter, due primarily to reduced headcount and marketing spend, as we started to benefit from the actions we took to reduce cost last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We never thought it would look like this, but we just weren't sure, so it was really a question of extending with our sellers, extending due diligence, extending closings, restructuring deals to be more capital efficient.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2020-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"In fact this Saturday, we will raise prices nationwide for the fifth time this calendar year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/08/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2020-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"Layered on top of these national increases are many more frequent community specific price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/08/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2020 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2020-12-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"The year-over-year reduction in SG&A is due to our efforts to streamline operations and become more efficient in ways we believe will result in permanent cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/08/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"Demand for new homes remains incredibly strong, and we are enjoying pricing power in nearly all of our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"Based on this backlog and the current market dynamics where we continue to experience strong pricing power, we expect further gross margin expansion in the fiscal year 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"Our efforts in this area continue as we seek to further refine and streamline our products and processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"We continue to look for ways to optimize our cost structure to achieve permanent cost savings, including more effective marketing spend, while increasing buyer engagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2021-02-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"As Doug mentioned, we are also increasing our guidance on nearly all of our key metrics for the full fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"Our strong order growth coupled with significant and consistent price increases sets the stage for meaningful, revenue earnings margin and ROE growth in fiscal year 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We continue to raise prices in nearly all of our communities during the second quarter and into the start of our third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"We attribute this primarily to leverage resulting from higher revenue, the continuing impact of the cost savings initiatives taken in 2020, reductions in advertising spend and our relentless focus on controlling overhead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin P. Connor","x":"In addition to revenue leverage and the ongoing benefit of past cost saving actions, we expect to benefit from lower sales commissions that we are now paying to outside brokers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"As a result of our excellent results in the quarter and based on the significant visibility our backlog provides, we are raising our full year guidance on nearly all key metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2021-05-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"We also reaffirm our guidance for 10% community count growth in fiscal '22 and this guidance is based solely on the land that we already control today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"This increase in ASP shows the pricing power of our luxury business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/25/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"During the third quarter and into the start of our fourth quarter, we raised prices in most of our communities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/25/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2021-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"…basis points, due primarily to the strong pricing in our backlog, which reflects the significant price increases that we've implemented over the past year, plus the operating efficiencies that we continue to gain to optimize floor plans, curated options in our design studios and streamlined…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/08/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2021 Q4","e":"tol","d":"2021-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas C. Yearley","x":"In the fourth quarter, we raised prices in nearly all markets and limited lot releases in about 20% of our communities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/08/toll-brothers-inc-tol-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2026-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Alan Ratner","x":"As you think about labor and cost in general, obviously, I think that was the big positive surprise in '25 in terms of the cost relief that builders were able to see in spite of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/toll-brothers-tol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2026-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Douglas Yearley","x":"Alan, we are not seeing the impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/toll-brothers-tol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alan Ratner","x":"But I'm curious, as we head into the spring, which typically does have a little more pricing power than the winter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/toll-brothers-tol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jay McCanless","x":"Could you talk about the opportunity to raise prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/toll-brothers-tol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q1","e":"tol","d":"2026-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Maklari","x":"And then you mentioned some of those headcount reductions that you recently implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/toll-brothers-tol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2026-05-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Karl Mistry","x":"So we've seen very modest impacts, if any, from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/20/toll-brothers-tol-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2026-05-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rafe Jadrosich","x":"And then you mentioned earlier that stick and brick costs were flattish sequentially even though there's been some increase in lumber, obviously, seeing a lot of price increases announcements and diesel costs are up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/20/toll-brothers-tol-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q2","e":"tol","d":"2026-05-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Yearley","x":"Based on our first half performance, we are raising our full year guidance across all key homebuilding metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/20/toll-brothers-tol-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q3","e":"tol","d":"2026-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Mistry","x":"We've actually been able to -- about 30% of our communities were able to raise prices in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/25/toll-brothers-tol-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOL 2026 Q3","e":"tol"